---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PaperPlanes from "../components/PaperPlanes.astro";
---

<Layout title="Nicholas Charriere">
  <p>
    I build products. I trained as an engineer, but I deeply care about craft:
    the details that make software feel wonderful. I'm optimistic about technology.
  </p>
  <p class="pt-6">
    Currently working on AI products at Notion with some wonderful people.
  </p>
  <p class="pt-6">
    Previously, founded{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://getmocha.com">Mocha</a>: I went through YC in '23 and
    built a full-stack app builder for non-technical customers. Over 300,000 people
    used Mocha to build sites and tools for their businesses. I'm proud of the
    product but we couldn't quite make the unit economics work. Building companies
    is hard.
  </p>
  <p class="pt-6">
    Before that, I was a founding engineer at{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://privy.io">Privy</a>, spent 4 years on the ML platform team at{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://getcruise.com">Cruise</a>, 2 years at{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://pinterest.com">Pinterest</a>{" "}
    building real-time ML systems, and a few years working full-stack at early-stage
    startups.
  </p>
  <p class="pt-6">
    I live in California but grew up and{" "}
    <a
      class="text-link hover:underline"
      href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mines_Paris_%E2%80%93_PSL"
      >studied</a
    >{" "}in Paris. I miss good croissants.
  </p>
  <p class="pt-6">
    Find me on{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://x.com/nichochar">X</a>,{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://github.com/nichochar">GitHub</a>, and{" "}
    <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicholas-charriere/">LinkedIn</a>.
  </p>
  <PaperPlanes />
</Layout>
